WEBVTT

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.394
Do you know about
Season Fairies?

00:00:03.637 --> 00:00:07.095
They're tiny fairies who make
rainfall, snowfall, wind, and clouds...

00:00:07.274 --> 00:00:11.040
We make lightening crash
with a rumble and a flash!

00:00:11.145 --> 00:00:14.740
And make crackling ice.

00:00:14.815 --> 00:00:18.273
They are tiny fairies who
control all kinds of seasons.

00:00:18.886 --> 00:00:21.150
-In other words, us!
-In other words, us!

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.986
Although we're still
only half-fledged...

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:27.928
A-hem! I'm going to
be a full fairy soon.

00:00:27.928 --> 00:00:29.395
-What?
-What?

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.760
What do you mean?
That's rude!

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:35.468
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.071
On my lips,

00:00:39.173 --> 00:00:43.769
The rouge of tears.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:07.091
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:07.201 --> 00:01:14.573
I don't want to know
such a thing as love.

00:01:18.145 --> 00:01:21.748
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:24.546
On my lips,

00:01:24.585 --> 00:01:29.545
The rouge of tears.

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:36.122
On Thursdays

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:39.097
I buy roses and...

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:43.363
add a letter.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:50.577
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:50.577 --> 00:01:53.480
When I see you
in my dreams,

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:58.543
you're so caring.

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:05.654
Your Magic Flower grew a bud?

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:07.056
Yeah!

00:02:08.262 --> 00:02:12.366
It's true. The cutest
little bud popped out!

00:02:12.366 --> 00:02:14.701
Did you find a "Twinkle"?

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:15.497
Huh?

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:18.967
The Magic Flower won't grow
unless you find a "Twinkle", right?

00:02:19.273 --> 00:02:21.468
Oh, yeah.
That's right.

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:24.636
Huh?
But if that's true...

00:02:24.745 --> 00:02:26.235
How come?

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:30.012
Basil. Cinnamon.

00:02:31.218 --> 00:02:33.153
If you haven't found a "Twinkle",

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.587
how come your
Magic Flower is growing?

00:02:35.689 --> 00:02:38.123
It's weird for it
to grow a bud.

00:02:38.225 --> 00:02:40.659
But it just grew.

00:02:40.761 --> 00:02:42.929
We've been looking
for a "Twinkle"

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:45.232
every day to make our
Magic Flowers grow.

00:02:45.232 --> 00:02:47.097
So how come
you're the only one?

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.725
I didn't know you guys
were looking for a "Twinkle."

00:02:49.803 --> 00:02:51.100
-We were, so there!
-We were, so there!

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:54.608
Still, it is strange that your
Magic Flower would grow

00:02:54.608 --> 00:02:58.100
without finding a "Twinkle".

00:02:58.645 --> 00:03:01.478
Did you cheat somehow?

00:03:01.515 --> 00:03:03.210
I never cheated!

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:04.284
-Then how come?

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:06.115
-Then how come?
-How come it grew?

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:10.090
I... I...

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.990
I found a "Twinkle",
so there!!

00:03:15.329 --> 00:03:17.388
R-Really?

00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:21.034
What on earth is
a "Twinkle" like?

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:25.672
Uh, well. It was
sparkly and really pretty!

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:26.907
-Really?

00:03:26.907 --> 00:03:27.999
-Really?
-Really.

00:03:28.342 --> 00:03:31.278
Ok, show us the
"Twinkle" as proof.

00:03:31.278 --> 00:03:32.836
-Huh?
-Ok, let's go!

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:34.277
Uh, no!

00:03:35.115 --> 00:03:36.082
Why not?

00:03:36.183 --> 00:03:38.083
Um, because...

00:03:38.719 --> 00:03:42.553
The "Twinkle" I found
turned into a bud.

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:44.953
But I'll find another one soon.

00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:47.424
All right, it's a deal!

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:49.188
Keep your word.

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:51.698
Oh, dear.

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:55.429
Those two are as
impolite as always.

00:03:55.535 --> 00:03:59.403
But I never knew
Sugar found a "Twinkle".

00:03:59.506 --> 00:04:00.607
If she found one once,

00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:02.642
she can find another
one soon, right?

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.734
Right, Sugar?

00:04:04.478 --> 00:04:06.469
What's the matter, Sugar?

00:04:08.749 --> 00:04:09.875
Don't tell me...

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.792
I thought so.

00:04:18.792 --> 00:04:22.489
I thought it was strange
you found a "Twinkle".

00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:27.528
It's just like you to get excited
and say something like that.

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:32.229
Still... Then why does only
Sugar's Magic Flower have a bud?

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:35.208
Maybe it's a coincidence?

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:38.006
Maybe it just
happened to happen?

00:04:40.247 --> 00:04:42.408
So what are you
going to do, Sugar?

00:04:42.516 --> 00:04:47.020
Maybe you should apologize to
them and tell them the truth.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.510
I'll find it.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:52.926
I'll really find a "Twinkle"!

00:04:52.926 --> 00:04:56.157
I'll make the Magic Flower
grow all by myself, you'll see!

00:04:57.063 --> 00:04:59.258
Hey, look, Saga!

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:00.196
Ta-dah!

00:05:00.834 --> 00:05:02.495
What's that?

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:06.339
I went everywhere and collected
all the photos of Cheryl I could find.

00:05:06.339 --> 00:05:08.136
Aren't they wonderful?

00:05:08.508 --> 00:05:11.341
Norma, you're still
nuts about her.

00:05:11.445 --> 00:05:13.436
What about you, Anne?

00:05:15.582 --> 00:05:16.516
This?

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:19.352
It's Shakespeare.
It's a classic play.

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:21.354
See?
She's being influenced.

00:05:21.354 --> 00:05:22.616
That's for sure!

00:05:22.956 --> 00:05:24.423
See? That's her, right?

00:05:24.524 --> 00:05:26.048
Wow!
You're right!

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:28.320
You're totally popular now

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:30.988
after playing the piano
for the troupe.

00:05:31.097 --> 00:05:33.400
I-I am not!

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:36.403
Yeesh! Those kids
are such groupies.

00:05:36.403 --> 00:05:37.771
You're one to talk, Norma.

00:05:37.771 --> 00:05:40.501
Don't get a swelled
head, Miss Saga.

00:05:40.607 --> 00:05:41.575
Greta...

00:05:41.575 --> 00:05:43.643
No matter how much
attention you receive,

00:05:43.643 --> 00:05:45.378
a stagehand is
still a stagehand.

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:49.439
It's a far cry from actually
standing on the stage like I did.

00:05:51.785 --> 00:05:53.275
Hey, it's her!

00:05:53.854 --> 00:05:55.589
Oh, my.
Do you recognize me?

00:05:55.589 --> 00:05:57.989
You're the one who did the
weird dance on the stage!

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:02.618
Return to your
own classrooms!

00:06:02.729 --> 00:06:05.254
Get going, I said!
Shoo! Shoo!

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.959
I see a "Twinkle"!

00:06:13.607 --> 00:06:15.939
Hey! What are you
doing all of a sudden?

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:20.213
Saga, wasn't
that a "Twinkle"?

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:21.703
Then...

00:06:24.518 --> 00:06:26.019
That's one!

00:06:26.019 --> 00:06:27.888
This? Is this a "Twinkle"?

00:06:27.888 --> 00:06:28.912
What?

00:06:32.726 --> 00:06:34.494
W-What's wrong
with you guys?

00:06:34.494 --> 00:06:37.292
Why are you dropping
important things like that?

00:06:39.266 --> 00:06:41.368
What in the world is this?

00:06:41.368 --> 00:06:43.859
Is this one?
Is this a "Twinkle"?

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.130
Hey!

00:06:52.312 --> 00:06:54.381
What in the world is
wrong with you?

00:06:54.381 --> 00:06:58.010
Suddenly you're saying "Twinkle"
like you just remembered it.

00:06:58.051 --> 00:06:59.780
Did something happen?

00:07:00.854 --> 00:07:01.878
Here.

00:07:05.926 --> 00:07:09.896
Must be pretty serious
if you can't eat.

00:07:09.896 --> 00:07:11.488
Hey, Sugar!

00:07:12.365 --> 00:07:13.855
Salt. Pepper.

00:07:16.303 --> 00:07:17.998
I see.

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:22.370
Come to think of it, you both
saw the Magic Flower grow, right?

00:07:22.409 --> 00:07:25.810
Is it true that
it grew a bud?

00:07:25.879 --> 00:07:27.972
Huh? Yes.

00:07:35.722 --> 00:07:36.923
It's true.

00:07:36.923 --> 00:07:40.051
But we don't know whether it
was because of a "Twinkle" or not.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.028
That's why I'll start
to find one now!

00:07:42.028 --> 00:07:45.555
I'm going to make the Magic Flower
bloom with my own power!

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:47.300
All right, all right.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.636
But how are you
going to find it?

00:07:49.636 --> 00:07:52.696
By the way, you won't find
that sort of thing around me.

00:07:54.107 --> 00:07:56.710
Hey, why don't
you ask Elder?

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.268
He would know.

00:07:58.778 --> 00:08:00.880
Elder won't tell us.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:01.815
Why not?

00:08:01.815 --> 00:08:05.876
The search for "Twinkle"
is our greatest training.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:10.579
Elder says that we can't become
full-fledged Season Fairies

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.386
unless we find
it for ourselves.

00:08:17.197 --> 00:08:20.030
Ginger!

00:08:21.267 --> 00:08:22.168
Gin-

00:08:22.168 --> 00:08:23.465
-ger!

00:08:23.737 --> 00:08:25.538
Baby!

00:08:25.538 --> 00:08:27.407
What do you think?

00:08:27.407 --> 00:08:29.943
I see.
That's it, huh?

00:08:29.943 --> 00:08:32.946
My original Ginger pose
is finally complete.

00:08:32.946 --> 00:08:36.182
With this, I'll finally
grasp her heart.

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:39.276
I'm coming for you now,
my beloved Ginger!

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.555
I've been looking
for you, Elder.

00:08:42.555 --> 00:08:44.386
So this is where
you've been.

00:08:44.491 --> 00:08:46.326
Hey, let go!
Let go!

00:08:46.326 --> 00:08:48.395
I have something
important to do!

00:08:48.395 --> 00:08:50.829
What I'm going to
grasp isn't me, it's...

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.564
You want me to tell you
what a "Twinkle" is?

00:08:57.170 --> 00:09:00.306
I don't want an answer. I just want
to be pointed in the right direction.

00:09:00.306 --> 00:09:01.508
Out of the question!

00:09:01.508 --> 00:09:04.344
Telling you that will not
benefit Sugar and the others.

00:09:04.344 --> 00:09:07.213
A "Twinkle" is something
they must find for themselves.

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:09.078
Well, I must be going now!

00:09:09.549 --> 00:09:12.786
But that won't get
them anywhere.

00:09:12.786 --> 00:09:15.277
It's not fair to
them at this rate.

00:09:17.123 --> 00:09:18.613
W-What is it?

00:09:18.992 --> 00:09:21.688
So you've begun to
sympathize with Sugar.

00:09:22.195 --> 00:09:22.820
Huh?

00:09:22.996 --> 00:09:26.733
So why don't you go with
her to help find a "Twinkle"?

00:09:26.733 --> 00:09:29.135
You never know. You
might be able to find one.

00:09:29.135 --> 00:09:30.966
Actually, I'm certain you will.

00:09:31.971 --> 00:09:33.905
What do you mean?

00:09:33.973 --> 00:09:36.009
You can't find a "Twinkle"

00:09:36.009 --> 00:09:39.312
if you're busy trying to
discover what a "Twinkle" is!

00:09:39.312 --> 00:09:43.271
You must broaden your
vision and look outside!!

00:09:43.383 --> 00:09:46.784
Then you will surely find one.
What do you think?

00:09:47.487 --> 00:09:49.478
Look outside?

00:10:01.801 --> 00:10:02.927
I'm home!

00:10:08.141 --> 00:10:10.166
-Sugar?
-Welcome home.

00:10:11.077 --> 00:10:12.408
What are you doing?

00:10:12.479 --> 00:10:15.607
This? This is a plan.

00:10:15.715 --> 00:10:16.545
A plan?

00:10:16.649 --> 00:10:20.346
I can't find a "Twinkle" if I just look
for one, so I'm making a plan.

00:10:21.387 --> 00:10:23.523
If I make a plan and
search really hard,

00:10:23.523 --> 00:10:26.515
I might be able to
find a "Twinkle". Right?

00:10:28.928 --> 00:10:31.021
Just wait, Magic Flower.

00:10:31.297 --> 00:10:33.265
I'll make you bloom.

00:10:38.538 --> 00:10:41.341
Do you want me
to make a plan?

00:10:41.341 --> 00:10:42.365
Huh?

00:10:42.909 --> 00:10:45.578
Tomorrow let's go out to look
for a "Twinkle" together.

00:10:45.578 --> 00:10:46.909
I'll help you.

00:10:47.547 --> 00:10:49.037
Saga...

00:10:51.084 --> 00:10:52.517
Waffo!

00:10:52.619 --> 00:10:53.720
Really, Saga?

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:56.655
Will you really come to look
for a "Twinkle" with me?

00:10:56.756 --> 00:10:59.359
Do you want to go look
outside the town wall?

00:10:59.359 --> 00:11:00.587
We'll bring lunch.

00:11:02.562 --> 00:11:05.398
Waffo! Smooch!
Smooch! Smooch!

00:11:05.398 --> 00:11:08.735
That's great! I'll help
you make the lunch.

00:11:08.735 --> 00:11:11.499
Oh! Can I also invite
Salt and Pepper?

00:11:12.438 --> 00:11:14.841
Oh, yeah!
We also have to bring...

00:11:14.841 --> 00:11:16.706
Waffos for lunch!

00:11:44.871 --> 00:11:47.006
I sure am surprised.

00:11:47.006 --> 00:11:49.475
I can't believe that Saga is going
to help us look for a "Twinkle".

00:11:49.475 --> 00:11:52.011
Really. I'm shocked.

00:11:52.011 --> 00:11:54.980
Don't go too far and
do something without me.

00:11:55.381 --> 00:11:56.575
-Ok!
-Ok!

00:12:03.523 --> 00:12:05.024
Hey, it's Ginger!

00:12:05.024 --> 00:12:07.117
-Hey, you're right!
-Hi, Ginger!

00:12:09.128 --> 00:12:10.396
That's unusual.

00:12:10.396 --> 00:12:13.160
You guys never come
all the way out here.

00:12:13.266 --> 00:12:16.035
We came looking for
a "Twinkle" with Saga.

00:12:16.035 --> 00:12:17.764
She invited us.

00:12:18.171 --> 00:12:19.468
Really?

00:12:19.572 --> 00:12:22.942
Say, you're an adult Season Fairy.
Right, Ginger?

00:12:22.942 --> 00:12:25.211
Can you tell us
what a "Twinkle" is?

00:12:25.211 --> 00:12:27.747
I can't tell you that,

00:12:27.747 --> 00:12:30.545
but I think you'll find
one if you're with them.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:31.548
Huh?

00:12:31.651 --> 00:12:33.519
Well, I have work to do.

00:12:33.519 --> 00:12:35.646
Good luck finding a "Twinkle".

00:12:37.023 --> 00:12:40.356
Awe, she could at least
give us a little hint.

00:12:51.471 --> 00:12:52.961
Wow...

00:13:00.546 --> 00:13:01.570
Waffo!

00:13:01.681 --> 00:13:03.740
Hey, don't go too far!

00:13:04.317 --> 00:13:06.285
I know! Oh!

00:13:07.153 --> 00:13:09.417
Is that a "Twinkle"?
Waffo!

00:13:11.357 --> 00:13:12.346
Huh?

00:13:14.994 --> 00:13:16.162
-What's this?

00:13:16.162 --> 00:13:17.720
-What's this?
-Too bad.

00:13:49.829 --> 00:13:52.059
Whew, I'm stuffed.

00:13:52.899 --> 00:13:53.866
Huh?

00:13:56.769 --> 00:13:58.871
Oh, my!
It's a rabbit.

00:13:58.871 --> 00:14:01.240
Mr. Rabbit! Waffo!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.832
Wow, he's fluffy!

00:14:08.481 --> 00:14:09.607
Sugar!

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:15.480
Sugar!

00:14:16.622 --> 00:14:18.180
Sugar, where are you?

00:14:18.758 --> 00:14:20.248
Saga...

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:22.295
-Sugar, where are you?

00:14:22.295 --> 00:14:23.990
-Sugar, where are you?
-Help.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:25.654
Sugar!

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:28.401
Saga.

00:14:28.401 --> 00:14:31.165
Yeesh! You really make
a lot of trouble for me.

00:14:33.373 --> 00:14:36.399
The "Twinkle" search
isn't going too well, is it?

00:14:36.509 --> 00:14:37.999
Yeah.

00:14:38.544 --> 00:14:42.081
So, why don't you go with
her to help find a "Twinkle"?

00:14:42.081 --> 00:14:44.072
You never know. You
might be able to find one.

00:14:44.851 --> 00:14:48.116
I think you'll find one
if you're with them.

00:14:48.755 --> 00:14:50.590
-They're all so irresponsible.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:51.454
-They're all so irresponsible.
-What?

00:14:51.958 --> 00:14:53.357
Um, it's nothing.

00:14:53.593 --> 00:14:55.720
Let's go looking
again sometime.

00:14:56.295 --> 00:14:58.422
What? Are we going
back already?

00:14:58.531 --> 00:15:00.867
It will get dark if
we stay too long.

00:15:00.867 --> 00:15:03.836
I'll come look with
you again soon, ok?

00:15:03.936 --> 00:15:04.903
Ok.

00:15:05.338 --> 00:15:08.136
Come on. Let's go home
before it gets late. Huh?

00:15:12.912 --> 00:15:14.380
What's wrong, Saga?

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:17.144
Huh? Oh, nothing.
Let's go.

00:15:21.721 --> 00:15:23.450
Did we come
through here before?

00:15:23.556 --> 00:15:27.253
Do you suppose we are lost?

00:15:36.903 --> 00:15:38.632
I can't move anymore.

00:15:38.738 --> 00:15:40.729
This is a problem...

00:15:42.575 --> 00:15:43.735
Someone!

00:15:44.777 --> 00:15:46.574
Is anybody there?

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:48.674
Hello?

00:15:52.518 --> 00:15:53.820
-What should we do?

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:54.821
-What should we do?
-Saga...

00:15:54.821 --> 00:15:57.289
That's why I told you.
This is all because you...

00:15:57.857 --> 00:16:00.052
went off on your own...

00:16:00.793 --> 00:16:02.556
I'm sorry. Never mind.

00:16:03.463 --> 00:16:04.953
Saga...

00:16:06.099 --> 00:16:07.589
I know!

00:16:08.334 --> 00:16:13.135
If I play my magic piccolo,
a Season Fairy might notice us!

00:16:14.373 --> 00:16:15.475
-Sugar.

00:16:15.475 --> 00:16:16.407
-Sugar.
-That's it!

00:16:34.327 --> 00:16:35.624
Miss Saga.

00:16:35.962 --> 00:16:38.988
It would be good to
be heard by people, too.

00:17:07.727 --> 00:17:09.217
Turmeric!

00:17:12.565 --> 00:17:13.589
So...

00:17:13.799 --> 00:17:16.369
You came all this way
looking for a "Twinkle".

00:17:16.369 --> 00:17:20.006
Turmeric, please tell
us the way home.

00:17:20.006 --> 00:17:22.406
Were you helping them
find a "Twinkle"?

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:29.949
The city is in that direction.

00:17:29.949 --> 00:17:31.439
Be careful going home.

00:17:31.551 --> 00:17:32.540
Also...

00:17:32.985 --> 00:17:37.684
You might find a "Twinkle" on
the way home if you're with them.

00:17:38.691 --> 00:17:39.692
-Bye.

00:17:39.692 --> 00:17:41.819
-Bye.
-Thank you, Turmeric!

00:17:41.928 --> 00:17:42.587
Hey!

00:17:42.695 --> 00:17:45.398
If he knows the way, he
could at least take us there.

00:17:45.398 --> 00:17:46.432
At any rate,

00:17:46.432 --> 00:17:49.035
we know the
way home now.

00:17:49.035 --> 00:17:51.337
Just a little more effort!
Let's all go! Waffo!

00:17:51.337 --> 00:17:52.929
-Waffo!
-Hey, Sugar!

00:17:54.106 --> 00:17:55.733
Hey, wait!

00:18:01.681 --> 00:18:03.216
I can't go any farther.

00:18:03.216 --> 00:18:05.446
What happened
to your energy?

00:18:06.852 --> 00:18:09.082
It's only a little farther, Sugar.
Only a little farther.

00:18:12.325 --> 00:18:13.226
-Sugar?

00:18:13.226 --> 00:18:14.454
-Sugar?
-Saga, over there!

00:18:23.236 --> 00:18:26.171
We found it!
We found a "Twinkle"!!

00:18:26.472 --> 00:18:27.905
Sugar!

00:18:30.309 --> 00:18:31.742
A "Twinkle"?

00:18:34.814 --> 00:18:36.805
Is it really a "Twinkle"?

00:18:38.417 --> 00:18:39.907
Waffo!

00:18:52.164 --> 00:18:53.631
Oh, yuck!

00:18:53.733 --> 00:18:55.223
Are you all right?

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.976
What is this? I was so sure it
was a "Twinkle" this time, too.

00:19:03.976 --> 00:19:07.707
The lake water reflected
the light of the sun.

00:19:08.247 --> 00:19:10.579
So it wasn't a "Twinkle"?

00:19:11.317 --> 00:19:12.079
Oh!

00:19:15.288 --> 00:19:16.778
We made it back.

00:19:19.792 --> 00:19:21.027
-Saga, you're soaked!

00:19:21.027 --> 00:19:22.517
-Saga, you're soaked!
-So are you, Sugar.

00:19:25.564 --> 00:19:26.690
Sorry.

00:19:26.799 --> 00:19:28.960
Now you've done it!
Take that!

00:19:29.669 --> 00:19:30.303
-Hey, you!

00:19:30.303 --> 00:19:31.604
-Hey, you!
-Ok, count me in!

00:19:31.604 --> 00:19:33.697
Oh, dear. You
guys are so silly!

00:19:50.589 --> 00:19:52.523
We didn't find one after all.

00:19:52.858 --> 00:19:53.826
-Huh?

00:19:53.826 --> 00:19:54.986
-Huh?
-A "Twinkle".

00:19:55.161 --> 00:19:56.796
Oh, yeah.

00:19:56.796 --> 00:19:59.765
But that's ok.
I had a lot of fun today!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.990
Hey, Saga?

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:07.364
I'll tell Basil and
Cinnamon the truth.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:09.375
Sugar...

00:20:09.375 --> 00:20:11.577
I'll tell them that I
haven't found a "Twinkle"

00:20:11.577 --> 00:20:13.772
and that I don't know
what a "Twinkle" is.

00:20:13.879 --> 00:20:18.407
But that I was really
happy you came with me.

00:20:18.517 --> 00:20:20.644
Thanks for what you did
today, Saga. Smooch.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:23.385
This is the opposite
of the other day.

00:20:24.023 --> 00:20:25.057
What is?

00:20:25.057 --> 00:20:27.457
The other day
I thanked you.

00:20:28.127 --> 00:20:29.788
Hey, you're right.

00:20:32.865 --> 00:20:34.633
Waffo! Saga!
Look! Look!

00:20:34.633 --> 00:20:37.101
What is it, Sugar?
It's too early in the morning.

00:20:37.937 --> 00:20:39.802
See? A new bud!

00:20:40.339 --> 00:20:41.240
-You did it!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.036
-You did it!
-Yeah!

00:20:42.475 --> 00:20:44.067
Sugar!

00:20:44.777 --> 00:20:47.678
You won't believe it! There's
a bud on my Magic Flower!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.148
Mine, too! Huh?

00:20:49.148 --> 00:20:51.343
Yours has another, Sugar?

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.418
Yeah!
But why?

00:20:54.186 --> 00:20:55.521
-You're lucky.

00:20:55.521 --> 00:20:56.555
-You're lucky.
-Basil. Cinnamon.

00:20:56.555 --> 00:20:59.718
You guys really
found a "Twinkle".

00:20:59.959 --> 00:21:02.985
Huh? Y-Yeah, well...

00:21:03.596 --> 00:21:06.432
Listen, it wasn't
like that before!

00:21:06.432 --> 00:21:09.268
I actually never
found a "Twinkle"!

00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:10.530
-Liar.
-Huh?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.600
I can see your
Magic Flower growing!

00:21:13.706 --> 00:21:16.402
You probably don't want to tell
us what a "Twinkle" is, that's all.

00:21:16.709 --> 00:21:19.200
Don't be stingy. Tell us!

00:21:19.311 --> 00:21:22.542
How do we find a "Twinkle"?

00:21:22.648 --> 00:21:24.639
We couldn't possibly
tell you that.

00:21:25.751 --> 00:21:30.289
The search for "Twinkle" is our
greatest training as Season Fairies.

00:21:30.289 --> 00:21:33.025
You can't become a full fairy
unless you find it for yourself.

00:21:33.025 --> 00:21:35.961
Humph. What a jerk.
Hey, let's go!

00:21:35.961 --> 00:21:38.452
We'll find one, too.
You'll see!

00:21:42.067 --> 00:21:44.058
So, how come?

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:45.371
The buds...

00:21:45.371 --> 00:21:47.339
It's not like we
found a "Twinkle",

00:21:47.339 --> 00:21:50.035
so how come our
Magic Flowers are growing?

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:53.110
Does it matter?

00:21:53.212 --> 00:21:57.410
If the Magic Flower grew by having
lots of fun, then it doesn't matter.

00:21:58.150 --> 00:21:58.912
Yeah!

00:21:59.452 --> 00:22:01.387
-That's true.
-Let's go again sometime.

00:22:01.387 --> 00:22:02.285
Yeah!

00:22:21.207 --> 00:22:24.768
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:25.778 --> 00:22:29.043
Melting in the water...

00:22:29.148 --> 00:22:34.420
I found a street
lined with trees.

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:38.516
Songs of stardust...

00:22:39.325 --> 00:22:47.666
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows

00:22:47.666 --> 00:22:52.467
You already knew...

00:22:52.872 --> 00:22:57.536
The happiness of
connecting our hearts...

00:22:57.843 --> 00:23:00.045
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.045 --> 00:23:08.020
When powdery snow
whirls in town,

00:23:08.020 --> 00:23:13.359
The season of flower
blossoms is near,

00:23:13.359 --> 00:23:18.092
And I think of you.

00:23:19.698 --> 00:23:26.505
The love that melts
our hearts and

00:23:26.505 --> 00:23:35.436
The dreams are
in your heart...

00:23:39.785 --> 00:23:40.686
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:40.686 --> 00:23:42.988
Preview of Next Episode
Hey, Saga! This time
when we go on a picnic,

00:23:42.988 --> 00:23:45.524
make me your hand-made
veggie sandwiches!

00:23:45.524 --> 00:23:47.626
Oh, all right.
I guess I can do that.

00:23:47.626 --> 00:23:48.861
-All right! Waffo!

00:23:48.861 --> 00:23:50.462
-All right! Waffo!
-Uh, then I'll have a fried potato!

00:23:50.462 --> 00:23:53.032
I would like an apple
cut into bunnies.

00:23:53.032 --> 00:23:54.800
-Ooh! That sounds good!
-That sounds good.

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:56.001
-I'd like wieners cut into octopuses!

00:23:56.001 --> 00:23:58.333
-I'd like wieners cut into octopuses!
-Th-That's all I can do!

00:23:58.804 --> 00:24:03.008
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"Pepper and the Dream of Mr. Turtle"

00:24:03.008 --> 00:24:05.408
I'll try hard, too.
